# President Salaheem (ToAU 3, mission.toau.president_salaheem). A level 75 Warrior of Bastok in Aht Urhgan Whitegate
# with it current, status 0: Naja Salaheem 73 (the Mog Locker scam; text table 0), finished: status 1 and the must-zone
# flag. Again: status 1, must zone: 3003 (the mercenary rank 0). A rezone clears the flag: 3020, finished: completed,
# Knight of Gold current (no reward items). The #nozone flow starts at status 1 with the flag clear.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/73 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3020
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau PresidentSalaheem current
login
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # status 0: 73
finish                                  # status 1, must zone
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # status 1, must zone: 3003
finish
rezone                                  # the flag cleared
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3020
finish                                  # completed
